{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40328","headline":"句 · 卢延让","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"只讹些子缘，应耗没多光。\n臂鹰健卒悬毡帽，骑马佳人卷画衫。\n每过私第邀看鹤，长着公裳送上驴。\n名纸毛生五门下，家僮骨立六街中。\n云间闹铎骡驼至，雪里残骸虎拽来。\n树上谘诹批颊鸟，窗间壁駮叩头虫。\n莫欺零落残牙齿，曾吃红绫饼餤来。\n渡水蹇驴双耳直，避风羸仆一肩高。\n高据襄阳播盛名，问人人道是诗星。\n凉雨打低残菡萏，急风吹散小蜻蜓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢延让","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40328.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40328","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}